- @post_event.make_a_wish

@erc
title: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="[+ parlament_current_ciu +]" data-summary="Minority government - [+ parlament_current_ciu_s +] / [+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="font-style: italic;color: [? if parlament_current_ciu = 'ciu': var(--ciu)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'cdc': var(--cdc)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'dl': var(--dl)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'pdcat': var(--pdcat)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'jxcat': var(--jxcat)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'junts': var(--junts)?]">minority government</span></span> (with ERC support)
choose-if: parlament_route_ciu_minority_erc_available
view-if: parlament_coalition_option_ciu_min_erc_visible and player_party == "erc"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if parlament_route_ciu_minority_erc_block_seats: Not enough parliamentary support. ?][? if parlament_route_ciu_minority_erc_block_relations: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] does not trust us enough to reach an investiture agreement. ?][? if parlament_route_ciu_minority_erc_block_roadmap: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] has no Roadmap for Independence. ?]
subtitle: [? if parlament_current_ciu_s > 40: Given the results, we're expected to support [+ parlament_current_ciu_leader +] ?][? if parlament_current_ciu_s <= 40: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] expects a coalition government given the results. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = Q.parlament_current_ciu;

    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage = Math.max(10, (Q.parlament_s_majority - Q.parlament_current_ciu_s));
    Q.coalition_phase_timer = 1;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
    Q.ciu_min_coalition_phase = 1;
!}

Before actual negotiations for us to support a [+ parlament_current_ciu +] minority government, the Parlament needs to convene under a new or renewed mandate. Having a majority together, the first order of business it deciding on the Speaker of the House. [? if parlament_current_ciu_s > 55: Given the results, [+ parlament_current_ciu +] at the very least expects us to also support them getting that position.?][? if parlament_current_ciu_s <= 40: Since the office of the President is expected to go to [+ parlament_current_ciu_leader +], [+ parlament_current_ciu +] are proposing that we take Speaker of the House.?]

- @ciu_speaker: [? if parlament_current_ciu_s > 40 : Let [+ parlament_current_ciu +] have the Speaker of the House?][? if parlament_current_ciu_s <= 40: Insist on yielding the Speaker of the House to [+ parlament_current_ciu +]?]
- @erc_speaker: [? if parlament_current_ciu_s > 55 : Push for having our Speaker of the House?][? if parlament_current_ciu_s <= 40: Take the position of Speaker of the House as expected. ?][? if parlament_current_ciu_s > 40 and parlament_current_ciu_s <= 55: Negotiate for us to have the Speaker of the House. ?]


@ciu_speaker
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    switch (Q.parlament_current_ciu) {
        case "ciu":
            Q.speaker = "Núria de Gispert";
            Q.speaker_gender = "f";
            break;
        case "cdc":
        case "dl":
            Q.speaker = "Carles Campuzano";
            Q.speaker_gender = "m";
            break;
        case "pdcat":
            Q.speaker = "Lluís Corominas";
            Q.speaker_gender = "m";
            break;
        case "jxcat":
        case "junts":
            if (Q.junts_leader != "Laura Borràs") {
                Q.speaker = "Laura Borràs";
                Q.speaker_gender = "f";
            } else {
                Q.speaker = "Albert Batet";
                Q.speaker_gender = "m";
            }
            break;
        default:
            Q.speaker = "Elsa Artadi";
            Q.speaker_gender = "f";
            break;
    }
    if (Q.parlament_current_ciu_s > 55) {
        Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] += 1;
    } else if (Q.parlament_current_ciu_s > 40) {
        Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] += 3;
    } else {
        Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 2;
    }
!}
go-to: post_speaker

@erc_speaker
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = "erc";
    if (Q.year < 2016) {
        Q.speaker = "Anna Simó";
        Q.speaker_gender = "f";
    } else {
        Q.speaker = "Roger Torrent";
        Q.speaker_gender = "m";
    }
    if (Q.parlament_current_ciu_s > 55) {
        Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 3;
    } else if (Q.parlament_current_ciu_s < 40) {
        Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] += 2;
    }
    Q.parlament_coalition_leverage -= 10;
!}
go-to: post_speaker

@post_speaker

[+ speaker +] will be the Speaker of the House for this legislature. Officially the second authority of the country, [+ speaker_party +] will now have a decisive role in the legislative agenda moving forwards. [? if parlament_current_ciu_s > 55 and speaker_party != parlament_current_ciu: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] is not pleased about having to yield this position. We'll have to see how this affects government negotiations. ?]

- @post_event: And so, time passes...

@cup
title: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="[+ parlament_current_ciu +]" data-summary="Minority government - [+ parlament_current_ciu_s +] / [+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="font-style: italic;color: [? if parlament_current_ciu = 'ciu': var(--ciu)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'cdc': var(--cdc)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'dl': var(--dl)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'pdcat': var(--pdcat)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'jxcat': var(--jxcat)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'junts': var(--junts)?]">minority government</span></span> (with ERC support)
view-if: parlament_coalition_option_ciu_min_erc_visible and player_party == "cup"
subtitle: [? if parlament_current_ciu_s <= 40: Push ERC to support a [+ parlament_current_ciu +]-only government. ?][? if parlament_current_ciu_s > 40: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] is expecting ERC to support their minority government. ?] 
choose-if: parlament_route_ciu_minority_erc_available
unavailable-subtitle: [? if parlament_route_ciu_minority_erc_block_seats: Not enough parliamentary support. ?][? if parlament_route_ciu_minority_erc_block_roadmap: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] has no Roadmap for Independence. ?][? if parlament_route_ciu_minority_erc_block_relations: We don't have good enough relations with ERC to push them into this. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_current_ciu_s < 40) {
        Q.erc_relations -= 10;
        Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] += 15;
    }
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = Q.parlament_current_ciu;

    Q.cat_coalition = [Q.parlament_current_ciu];
    Q.cat_coalition_support = ["erc"];
    Q.cat_coalition_abstain = [];
    G.setText(Q, "cat_coalition_disp", G.text("{party} {government}", {
        party: String(Q.parlament_current_ciu),
        government: G.governmentTooltipText("generalitat", Q.cat_coalition, G.text("Minority government - {value2}/{majority}", {
            value2: String(Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_parlament_s"]),
            majority: String(Q.parlament_s_majority)
        }), G.text("<span style='color: var(--{party}); font-style: italic;'>minority government</span>", {
            party: String(Q.parlament_current_ciu)
        }))
    }));
    Q.erc_in_gob = false;
    Q.erc_supporting = true;
    Q.cup_in_gob = false;
    Q.cup_supporting = false;

    if (Q.parlament_current_ciu_s > 50) {
        Q.speaker_party = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
        switch (Q.parlament_current_ciu) {
            case "ciu":
                Q.speaker = "Núria de Gispert";
                Q.speaker_gender = "f";
                break;
            case "cdc":
            case "dl":
                Q.speaker = "Carles Campuzano";
                Q.speaker_gender = "m";
                break;
            case "pdcat":
                Q.speaker = "Lluís Corominas";
                Q.speaker_gender = "m";
                break;
            case "jxcat":
            case "junts":
                if (Q.junts_leader != "Laura Borràs") {
                    Q.speaker = "Laura Borràs";
                    Q.speaker_gender = "f";
                } else {
                    Q.speaker = "Albert Batet";
                    Q.speaker_gender = "m";
                }
                break;
            default:
                Q.speaker = "Elsa Artadi";
                Q.speaker_gender = "f";
                break;
        }
    } else {
        Q.speaker_party = "erc";
        if (Q.year < 2016) {
            Q.speaker = "Anna Simó";
            Q.speaker_gender = "f";
        } else {
            Q.speaker = "Roger Torrent";
            Q.speaker_gender = "m";
        }
    }

    G.setText(Q, "position_disp", G.text("<span style='font-style: italic'>Opposition</span>"));
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_setnames
set-jump: cup_display

@cup_display

[+ parlament_current_ciu +] and ERC have reached an agreement for the formation of a [+ cat_coalition_disp +]. The Speaker of the House will be [+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]), and the government has taken the following shape:

{!<div data-widget="cabinet-proposal"></div>!}

Some promises on independence commitments have been made, we'll have to monitor them closely as the legislature progresses. 

- @parlament_coalition_resolve: Yet another "convergent" bourgeois government...


@ppc_any
title: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="[+ parlament_current_ciu +]" data-summary="Minority government - [+ parlament_current_ciu_s +] / [+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="font-style: italic;color: [? if parlament_current_ciu = 'ciu': var(--ciu)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'cdc': var(--cdc)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'dl': var(--dl)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'pdcat': var(--pdcat)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'jxcat': var(--jxcat)?][? if parlament_current_ciu = 'junts': var(--junts)?]">minority government</span></span> (with PPC[? if parlament_route_ciu_right_use_unio:  + Unio?][? if parlament_route_ciu_right_use_pdcat:  + pdcat?] support)
choose-if: parlament_route_ciu_right_available
view-if: parlament_coalition_option_ciu_right_visible
unavailable-subtitle: [? if parlament_route_ciu_right_block_seats: Not enough parliamentary support. ?][? if parlament_route_ciu_right_block_roadmap: [+ parlament_current_ciu +] has an ongoing Roadmap to Independence, which the PPC will not tolerate. ?][? if parlament_route_ciu_right_block_relations: Catalonia-Spain relations are too strained. ?]
subtitle: Let the classical right reach an understanding like in the "good" old times. Pujolism will be back.
on-arrival: {!
    // TODO: What happens here besides govt assignments?
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_vp = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_bnl = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_territory = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_education = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_health = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_foreign = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_economy = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_interior = Q.parlament_current_ciu;

    if (Q.parlament_current_ciu_s > 50) {
        Q.speaker_party = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
        switch (Q.parlament_current_ciu) {
            case "ciu":
                Q.speaker = "Núria de Gispert";
                Q.speaker_gender = "f";
                break;
            case "cdc":
            case "dl":
                Q.speaker = "Carles Campuzano";
                Q.speaker_gender = "m";
                break;
            case "pdcat":
                Q.speaker = "Lluís Corominas";
                Q.speaker_gender = "m";
                break;
            case "jxcat":
            case "junts":
                if (Q.junts_leader != "Laura Borràs") {
                    Q.speaker = "Laura Borràs";
                    Q.speaker_gender = "f";
                } else {
                    Q.speaker = "Albert Batet";
                    Q.speaker_gender = "m";
                }
                break;
            default:
                Q.speaker = "Elsa Artadi";
                Q.speaker_gender = "f";
                break;
        }
    } else {
        Q.speaker_party = "ppc";
        Q.speaker = "Enric Millo";
        Q.speaker_gender = "m";
    }

    Q.cat_coalition = [Q.parlament_current_ciu];
    Q.cat_coalition_support = ["ppc"];
    if (Q.parlament_route_ciu_right_use_unio) Q.cat_coalition_support.push("unio");
    if (Q.parlament_route_ciu_right_use_pdcat) Q.cat_coalition_support.push("pdcat");
    Q.cat_coalition_abstain = [];
    G.setText(Q, "cat_coalition_disp", G.text("{party} {government}", {
        party: String(Q.parlament_current_ciu),
        government: G.governmentTooltipText("generalitat", Q.cat_coalition, G.text("Minority government - {value2}/{majority}", {
            value2: String(Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_parlament_s"]),
            majority: String(Q.parlament_s_majority)
        }), G.text("<span style='color: var(--{party}); font-style: italic;'>minority government</span>", {
            party: String(Q.parlament_current_ciu)
        }))
    }));

    Q.erc_in_gob = false;
    Q.erc_supporting = false;
    Q.cup_in_gob = false;
    Q.cup_supporting = false;

    G.setText(Q, "position_disp", G.text("<span style='font-style: italic'>Opposition</span>"));
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_setnames
set-jump: ppc_display

@ppc_display

After the events leading to the premature ending of Artur Mas's first mandate in 2012, no one would have imagined that CDC [? if parlament_current_ciu != "cdc" and parlament_current_ciu != "ciu": (now [+ parlament_current_ciu +])?] would be able to reach a governing agreement with the PPC for a long while. Yet here we are. This legislature's Speaker of the House will be [+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]), and the government has taken the following shape:

{!<div data-widget="cabinet-proposal"></div>!}

- @parlament_coalition_resolve: We can only hope this is not as bad as it looks...
